Most recent NEWS are here:

2026-11-17: 1.18: Wayland popup support: on Wayland the default and popover popup modes always use a GtkPopover anchored to the panel button (pointer positioning is ignored, Wayland clients cannot place popups); explicit window popup mode uses xfce_panel_plugin_popup_window() when built against libxfce4panel >= 4.19, with layer-shell placement when the panel library and compositor support it. Older libxfce4panel keeps the legacy behaviour. X11 behaviour, including -p pointer popups, is unchanged.
2026-11-17: 1.18: Popup mode is the xfconf property /popup-mode (auto, popover, window), or forced with HAMSTER_POPUP_MODE. Remote popup script: xfce4-popup-hamstermenu (also -p for pointer mode on X11).
2026-11-17: 1.18: cs translation is now shipped.
2026-11-17: 1.18: Build fixes: installed languages derived from po/*.po, CPack RPM file naming corrected, dead CMake rule and unused Intl requirement removed.

2021-04-06: #43: Changed from autotools to cmake

2021-04-05: #40: Editable grid view

2021-03-04: #28: Starting again activity does does not use category of past activity

2020-12-26: #36: Update to GTK+3 and xfce 4.16

2026-02-17: #48: refactor with new tooling



